01:06:26.920 --> 01:06:27.580
She is.
确实如此。

1170
01:06:27.760 --> 01:06:30.600
She's like, fine, we'll do it your way.
她就像是说，好吧，按你的方式来。

1171
01:06:30.820 --> 01:06:31.080
Hello.
你好。

1172
01:06:31.420 --> 01:06:32.580
Now we'll do it my way.
现在按我的方式来。

1173
01:06:32.740 --> 01:06:33.540
What do you have?
你这儿有什么？

1174
01:06:33.840 --> 01:06:34.280
Exactly.
没错。

1175
01:06:35.040 --> 01:06:41.980
Well, you know, I read that Bea Arthur's performance by all the critics at the time was singled out as a highlight of this holiday special.
你知道，我读到过当时的评论家们都把碧·亚瑟的表演挑出来，称其为这部假日特辑的一大亮点。

1176
01:06:42.060 --> 01:06:43.340
It was the highlight for me.
对我来说，这就是亮点。

1177
01:06:43.760 --> 01:06:44.900
This whole section.
整个这一段。

1178
01:06:45.080 --> 01:06:46.580
And this was all directed.
而且这一整段都是由……执导的。

1179
01:06:46.740 --> 01:06:50.500
Her whole section, she's about to sing, was directed by the first director.
她唱歌前的整段戏，都是由第一位导演执导的。

1180
01:06:50.580 --> 01:06:55.540
And I guess there are some rumors that the shoot was 24 hours.
我猜有传言说拍摄持续了24小时。

1181
01:06:55.900 --> 01:06:56.580
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1182
01:06:56.680 --> 01:06:59.660
It was a crazy, crazy shoot day.
那真是疯狂、疯狂的一天拍摄。

1183
01:06:59.660 --> 01:07:07.800
I saw in an interview that Bea Arthur said she was cast as Akmina thanks to her friendship with Ken and Mitzi Welch, two of the show's producers.
我在采访中看到碧·亚瑟说，多亏了她与该节目制片人肯·韦尔奇和米兹·韦尔奇夫妇的友谊，她才得以出演阿克米娜这个角色。

1184
01:07:08.100 --> 01:07:13.120
They also wrote the song Goodnight But Not Goodbye, which is the song that she's going to sing in a second.
他们还创作了《晚安，但不是永别》，也就是她一会儿要唱的那首歌。

1185
01:07:13.840 --> 01:07:17.280
Bea Arthur's commitment to the reality of the scene is really incredible.
碧·亚瑟对场景真实感的投入真是令人难以置信。

1186
01:07:17.680 --> 01:07:19.020
She is so fantastic.
她太棒了。

1187
01:07:19.360 --> 01:07:23.520
These Imperial Guards are going to come on the screen and they're going to impose a curfew.
这些帝国卫兵会出现在屏幕上，并实施宵禁。

1188
01:07:24.260 --> 01:07:25.940
Everyone has to leave the bar.
每个人都必须离开酒吧。

1189
01:07:26.160 --> 01:07:27.680
Yeah, she said, guys, we're closing.
是啊，她说，伙计们，我们要打烊了。

1190
01:07:27.680 --> 01:07:28.640
They're closing me down.
他们要关掉我的店了。

1191
01:07:28.760 --> 01:07:29.440
You got to leave.
你们得离开。

1192
01:07:29.660 --> 01:07:34.580
But everyone saw the Imperial Guard come on the screen and impose this curfew.
但每个人都看到了帝国卫兵出现在屏幕上并实施了宵禁。

1193
01:07:34.700 --> 01:07:36.640
It's not like she took a phone call in the back.
这又不是说她在后面接了个电话。

1194
01:07:36.820 --> 01:07:37.020
No.
没有。

1195
01:07:37.320 --> 01:07:39.300
They pop up on a screen like they do.
他们就像那样突然出现在屏幕上。

1196
01:07:39.660 --> 01:07:40.940
But no one will leave.
但没人愿意离开。

1197
01:07:41.100 --> 01:07:41.660
They don't care.
他们根本不在乎。

1198
01:07:41.700 --> 01:07:41.960
Why?
为什么？

1199
01:07:42.100 --> 01:07:43.040
Why won't they leave?
为什么他们不肯离开？

1200
01:07:43.180 --> 01:07:43.600
I don't know.
我不知道。

1201
01:07:43.600 --> 01:07:46.060
Why is she the only person afraid of this curfew?
为什么只有她一个人担心宵禁的事？

1202
01:07:46.200 --> 01:07:48.280
She's like begging them, you guys, you got to go.
她就像是在求他们，拜托各位，你们得走了。

1203
01:07:48.520 --> 01:07:53.060
She's like, I'll give you one more round of drinks and I'm going to sing you a song.
她说，我再给你们上一轮酒，然后给你们唱首歌。

1204
01:07:53.360 --> 01:07:54.700
And then you got to go.
之后你们就得走了。

1205
01:07:55.060 --> 01:07:55.600
You got to leave.
你们必须离开。

1206
01:07:56.240 --> 01:07:57.940
She should have put on the holiday special.
她本该放那个节日特辑的。

1207
01:07:58.700 --> 01:07:59.680
You know what?
你知道吗？

1208
01:07:59.860 --> 01:08:01.220
She didn't have it yet.
她当时还没那个特辑呢。

1209
01:08:01.320 --> 01:08:02.220
She didn't have it yet.
她当时还没那个特辑呢。

1210
01:08:02.360 --> 01:08:03.360
She didn't know.
她还不知道。

1211
01:08:03.660 --> 01:08:05.860
Let me tell you a little bit about Bea Arthur.
让我来给你们讲讲碧·亚瑟（Bea Arthur）。

1212
01:08:06.320 --> 01:08:08.760
She was an actress, a comedian, and a singer.
她是一位演员、喜剧演员和歌手。

1213
01:08:09.020 --> 01:08:14.280
She began her career on stage where she won a Tony for playing Vera in Mame.
她的职业生涯始于舞台，凭借在《妈妈》（Mame）中饰演薇拉（Vera）一角赢得了托尼奖。

1214
01:08:14.440 --> 01:08:19.220
So she was really a famous stage actress, musical theater star.
所以她确实是一位非常有名的舞台剧演员、音乐剧明星。

1215
01:08:19.700 --> 01:08:25.200
By the time she did this special, she was very well known for being in the comedy series
在拍摄这个特辑时，她已经因出演喜剧系列剧而家喻户晓了，

1216
01:08:25.200 --> 01:08:28.300
All in the Family and Maud, for which she won an Emmy Award.
比如《全家总动员》（All in the Family）和《莫德》（Maude），并凭借后者获得了艾美奖。

1217
01:08:28.620 --> 01:08:31.060
The holiday special was pre-Golden Girls, though.
不过这个节日特辑是在《黄金女郎》（Golden Girls）之前拍摄的。

1218
01:08:31.740 --> 01:08:33.340
Here's a fun fact about Bea Arthur.
关于碧·亚瑟，这里有个有趣的事实。

1219
01:08:33.680 --> 01:08:38.200
She has received the third most Emmy Award nominations with nine.
她以九次提名位列艾美奖提名次数第三多。

1220
01:08:38.800 --> 01:08:40.800
Do you know who's received the most?
你知道谁获得的提名最多吗？

1221
01:08:41.520 --> 01:08:42.360
Lucille Ball?
露西尔·鲍尔（Lucille Ball）？

1222
01:08:42.820 --> 01:08:43.200
No.
不是。

1223
01:08:44.060 --> 01:08:45.460
Julia Louis-Dreyfus.
朱莉娅·路易斯-德瑞弗斯（Julia Louis-Dreyfus）。

1224
01:08:45.540 --> 01:08:46.300
Oh, my goodness.
天哪。

1225
01:08:46.300 --> 01:08:48.140
Has been nominated 11 times.
她被提名了11次。

1226
01:08:48.400 --> 01:08:50.740
Mary Tyler Moore has been nominated 10.
玛丽·泰勒·摩尔（Mary Tyler Moore）被提名了10次。

1227
01:08:51.060 --> 01:08:52.960
And Bea Arthur has been nominated 9.
而碧·亚瑟被提名了9次。

1228
01:08:52.960 --> 01:09:00.280
like real chops in the special everyone yeah like serious amazing talent showed up for this thing
这个特辑里确实展现了真功夫，没错，真正了不起的才华都汇聚在这里了。

1229
01:09:00.280 --> 01:09:08.260
well she does eventually get everyone to leave and one other fun fact about this scene is that
好吧，她最终还是让所有人都离开了，关于这个场景的另一个有趣事实是，

1230
01:09:08.260 --> 01:09:14.800
some of the same aliens that we saw in the cantina in star wars are in the cantina again
我们在《星球大战》酒馆里看到的一些外星人又出现在了这里，

1231
01:09:14.800 --> 01:09:22.760
including the band yes i clocked that yeah do you know the band's name um no i don't
包括那个乐队，没错，我注意到了，你知道乐队的名字吗？嗯，不知道。

1232
01:09:22.760 --> 01:09:23.500
Okay.
好吧。

1233
01:09:24.740 --> 01:09:27.300
Figrin d'Anne and the modal nodes.
菲格林·丹（Figrin d'An）和模态节点乐队（Modal Nodes）。

1234
01:09:27.300 --> 01:09:35.440
Again, very similar to your belly.
再说一次，听起来很像你的肚子（belly）。

1235
01:09:37.380 --> 01:09:40.820
I thought it was Betsy Belly Welly or something.
我还以为是贝茜·贝利·韦利（Betsy Belly Welly）之类的名字。

1236
01:09:40.900 --> 01:09:40.950
Yeah.
是啊。

1237
01:09:40.950 --> 01:09:43.560
I'm telling you, maybe you and George Lucas, same brain.
我跟你说，也许你和乔治·卢卡斯（George Lucas）心有灵犀。

1238
01:09:44.720 --> 01:09:45.320
Yeah.
是啊。

1239
01:09:45.760 --> 01:09:47.420
We're really good at naming things.
我们真的很擅长起名字。

1240
01:09:47.500 --> 01:09:47.720
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1241
01:09:48.000 --> 01:09:49.460
To sound like snoofer lockers.
听起来像“斯努弗储物柜”（snoofer lockers）。

1242
01:09:49.780 --> 01:09:50.380
I know.
我知道。

1243
01:09:50.480 --> 01:09:51.220
Flunky-lokies.
“弗伦基-洛基”（Flunky-lokies）。

1244
01:09:52.900 --> 01:09:53.440
All right.
好吧。

1245
01:09:53.540 --> 01:09:55.560
Back at the Wookiee House, we hear an announcement.
回到伍基人（Wookiee）的房子，我们听到了一则广播。

1246
01:09:55.960 --> 01:09:59.140
The Imperial Guards are being told to return to base.
帝国卫兵被告知要返回基地。

1247
01:09:59.720 --> 01:10:00.600
Return to base.
返回基地。

1248
01:10:00.720 --> 01:10:01.300
But are they?
但他们真的要回去吗？

1249
01:10:01.620 --> 01:10:02.780
Are they being told that?
他们真的被告知要回去吗？

1250
01:10:02.780 --> 01:10:06.120
Or is it a trick from Lumpy, who got his little device working?
还是说这是兰比（Lumpy）的诡计，他把他的小装置修好了？

1251
01:10:06.340 --> 01:10:06.560
Yeah.
是啊。

1252
01:10:06.760 --> 01:10:07.540
We don't know.
我们不知道。

1253
01:10:07.700 --> 01:10:11.020
Again, there's just so much keeping up with the Imperial soldiers.
再说一次，要跟上帝国士兵的动向实在太难了。

1254
01:10:11.220 --> 01:10:12.380
There's so many announcements.
公告实在是太多了。

1255
01:10:12.640 --> 01:10:13.280
I know.
我知道。

1256
01:10:13.360 --> 01:10:14.980
I would just have announcement fatigue.
我肯定会听公告听到疲劳。

1257
01:10:14.980 --> 01:10:19.660
Well, the stormtrooper goes upstairs and catches Lumpy on his device.
好吧，冲锋队员上楼抓住了正在玩设备的兰比。

1258
01:10:19.900 --> 01:10:23.360
He takes it and he smashes it and he chases him downstairs.
他抢过设备摔碎，然后把兰比追下了楼。

1259
01:10:23.940 --> 01:10:26.680
And all of a sudden, guess who walks in the door?
突然，你猜谁进门了？

1260
01:10:27.140 --> 01:10:28.620
Han and Chewbacca.
汉和楚巴卡。

1261
01:10:28.800 --> 01:10:29.740
They made it.
他们成功赶到了。

1262
01:10:29.920 --> 01:10:31.980
But the Imperials are still present.
但帝国士兵还在场。

1263
01:10:32.400 --> 01:10:35.260
Chewbacca immediately runs to protect Lumpy.
楚巴卡立刻跑过去保护兰比。

1264
01:10:35.940 --> 01:10:43.900
Han confronts this whole situation and he kills the stormtrooper by tricking him into falling off the balcony.
汉面对这种局面，他诱骗冲锋队员掉下阳台，从而杀死了他。

1265
01:10:43.900 --> 01:10:48.560
This is probably why maybe they established how high up they were.
这大概就是为什么他们要特意交代阳台有多高吧。

1266
01:10:49.260 --> 01:10:51.600
It's a very, very short fight.
这打斗非常、非常短。

1267
01:10:52.060 --> 01:10:58.740
So all of this has been leading up to possibly one of the shortest fights I've ever seen in a movie.
所以这一切铺垫，可能就是为了引出我这辈子在电影里见过最短的打斗之一。

1268
01:10:59.300 --> 01:11:04.760
It's like two punches and a fake and then the guy's off the railing.
就像两拳加一个假动作，然后那家伙就掉下栏杆了。

1269
01:11:04.880 --> 01:11:05.720
And it's over.
这就结束了。

1270
01:11:05.980 --> 01:11:07.060
Sometimes that's all it takes.
有时候这就够了。

1271
01:11:07.320 --> 01:11:08.520
I guess that's all it takes.
我想这就够了。

1272
01:11:09.120 --> 01:11:10.680
The Wookiees embrace each other.
伍基人拥抱在一起。

1273
01:11:10.860 --> 01:11:16.220
And then there's this, Ange, what is happening between Chewie and his wife?
然后就是这一幕，安吉，楚伊和他妻子之间发生了什么？

1274
01:11:16.640 --> 01:11:17.780
What was that?
那是什么？

1275
01:11:18.100 --> 01:11:18.900
I don't know.
我不知道。

1276
01:11:19.120 --> 01:11:19.820
First of all.
首先。

1277
01:11:21.280 --> 01:11:24.500
It's like they come together like they're going to kiss.
他们凑在一起，看起来像是要接吻。

1278
01:11:24.660 --> 01:11:24.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1279
01:11:25.000 --> 01:11:26.440
But they don't kiss.
但他们没亲。

1280
01:11:26.540 --> 01:11:29.300
They just sort of breathe in each other's faces.
他们只是对着彼此的脸呼吸。

1281
01:11:29.300 --> 01:11:29.780
Yeah.
是啊。

1282
01:11:30.100 --> 01:11:36.360
Is it, was I meant to feel that as, what is it?
我是应该把它理解为……那是什么？

1283
01:11:37.260 --> 01:11:45.320
is it longing is it is she mad is she like i'm still kind of grumpy because you it looked tender
是渴望吗？还是她在生气？她是那种“我还在生闷气，因为你……”的感觉吗？看起来挺温柔的。

1284
01:11:45.320 --> 01:11:51.580
it looked tender i don't exactly anyone back there did you what what was your take on the
看起来挺温柔的。我不知道，后面有人看出来了吗？你们对楚伊和玛拉的拥抱怎么看？我们失去他们了，请稍等，他们离开了。

1285
01:11:51.580 --> 01:12:00.360
chewy mala embrace we've lost them please hold they've left
是啊，他们只是对着彼此的嘴呼吸了一分钟。

1286
01:12:02.560 --> 01:12:05.300
yeah they just kind of breathe in each other's mouths for a minute
是啊。

1287
01:12:05.740 --> 01:12:05.980
Yeah.
是啊。

1288
01:12:06.260 --> 01:12:06.460
Yeah.
是啊。

1289
01:12:06.760 --> 01:12:09.140
They don't ever kiss or maybe that's.
他们从来不接吻，或者说这就是他们的接吻方式？

1290
01:12:09.140 --> 01:12:10.240
Do Wookiees not kiss?
伍基人不接吻吗？

1291
01:12:10.460 --> 01:12:11.960
Maybe that's their form of kissing.
也许这就是他们的接吻方式。

1292
01:12:12.640 --> 01:12:13.580
No, Wookiees kiss.
不，伍基人会接吻。

1293
01:12:14.000 --> 01:12:21.100
Wookiees gotta kiss and like, I don't know, Mala's been making that dinner, worried about him and that's all she gets.
伍基人肯定会接吻，而且，我不知道，玛拉一直在做晚饭，担心他，结果就得到这个。

1294
01:12:21.340 --> 01:12:25.260
I like how quickly you guys were like, no, they kiss, let me tell you.
我喜欢你们刚才那种斩钉截铁的态度，不，他们接吻，让我来告诉你。

1295
01:12:25.380 --> 01:12:31.900
No, Cassie, my thing was that I thought Mala was like giving him like a cold shoulder a little bit.
不，凯西，我的意思是，我觉得玛拉当时有点冷落他。

1296
01:12:31.900 --> 01:12:36.240
Like, he came in to kiss, but, like, he could tell she was still a little pissed.
就像他凑过去想亲吻，但他能感觉到她还在生气。

1297
01:12:36.400 --> 01:12:36.740
Yeah.
是啊。

1298
01:12:37.080 --> 01:12:37.660
Or something.
或者类似的原因。

1299
01:12:37.940 --> 01:12:38.700
I like that.
我喜欢这个解释。

1300
01:12:38.940 --> 01:12:39.740
I don't know.
我不知道。

1301
01:12:40.100 --> 01:12:42.800
He's got to really, you know, win her back later tonight.
他真的得，你知道的，今晚晚些时候把她追回来。

1302
01:12:43.080 --> 01:12:43.980
I guess he does.
我想他是得这样。

1303
01:12:44.360 --> 01:12:46.200
I love that you're writing backstory for it.
我很喜欢你为它编写背景故事。

1304
01:12:48.700 --> 01:12:57.160
You know, the one thing that really got me is just, you know, how Han is like, hey, you know, you guys are like family to me, you know.
你知道，真正打动我的一点是，韩说，嘿，你们对我来说就像家人一样。

1305
01:12:57.820 --> 01:13:06.000
And then I'm sure in the stage direction, it said Mala looks at Han with adoration or something like that.
而且我敢肯定，舞台说明里写着玛拉深情地看着韩之类的。

1306
01:13:06.140 --> 01:13:11.600
But if you zoom in on Mala's face, the look is so crazy.
但如果你放大玛拉的脸，那个表情太疯狂了。

1307
01:13:12.140 --> 01:13:15.780
She's like, like, the look is so crazy.
她就像，那个表情真的太疯狂了。

1308
01:13:17.760 --> 01:13:18.320
Anyway.
总之。

1309
01:13:18.620 --> 01:13:21.920
Well, they don't make a lot of different facial expressions.
好吧，他们做不出太多不同的面部表情。

1310
01:13:22.180 --> 01:13:22.680
There's not a lot.
没多少表情。

1311
01:13:23.180 --> 01:13:24.440
Well, Han is going to leave.
好吧，韩要走了。

1312
01:13:24.580 --> 01:13:25.060
He's off.
他要离开了。

1313
01:13:25.300 --> 01:13:26.200
He's like, bye.
他就像是说，再见。

1314
01:13:26.400 --> 01:13:27.040
He's got to go.
他必须得走了。

1315
01:13:27.160 --> 01:13:27.660
Leyes.
莱耶斯。

1316
01:13:27.860 --> 01:13:28.840
Killed that guy.
干掉了那家伙。

1317
01:13:29.060 --> 01:13:30.220
Where's he going for life?
他要去哪儿生活？

1318
01:13:30.220 --> 01:13:30.800
I don't know.
