1455
01:21:33.830 --> 01:21:36.050
And remember, it can really be any topic.
记住，任何话题都可以。

1456
01:21:36.050 --> 01:21:38.550
Just what do you want to hear us talk about?
你们想听我们聊些什么呢？

1457
01:21:39.310 --> 01:21:42.610
Please, though, can I have a break from fantasy sci-fi?
不过拜托，能让我从奇幻科幻题材里歇一歇吗？

1458
01:21:43.150 --> 01:21:44.110
I'm begging you.
我求求你们了。

1459
01:21:44.270 --> 01:21:44.410
Yeah.
好吧。

1460
01:21:44.550 --> 01:21:46.290
Can we make Angela watch a horror movie?
我们可以让安吉拉看一部恐怖片吗？

1461
01:21:46.610 --> 01:21:48.190
No, I don't want to watch a horror movie.
不，我不想看恐怖片。

1462
01:21:48.350 --> 01:21:49.510
I hate horror movies.
我讨厌恐怖片。

1463
01:21:49.690 --> 01:21:49.930
Maybe.
也许吧。

1464
01:21:50.430 --> 01:21:50.730
No.
不行。

1465
01:21:51.110 --> 01:21:52.390
Write in and let us know.
写信告诉我们吧。

1466
01:21:52.390 --> 01:21:57.190
And please join us next Wednesday for our interview with Kathy Bates.
请下周三加入我们，收听我们对凯西·贝茨的采访。

1467
01:21:57.630 --> 01:21:58.450
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1468
01:21:58.450 --> 01:21:59.550
We were so excited.
我们太激动了。

1469
01:21:59.830 --> 01:22:00.850
We'll see you then.
到时见。

1470
01:22:02.030 --> 01:22:05.210
The sherbet and stew are such a disgusting combo.
果子露和炖菜的搭配真是太恶心了。

1471
01:22:05.210 --> 01:22:08.030
It's coming back on me in a gross, gross way.
它正以一种极其恶心的方式反胃上来。

1472
01:22:08.150 --> 01:22:09.410
I drank my whole drink.
我把我的那份饮料全喝光了。

1473
01:22:09.710 --> 01:22:11.410
Yeah, I feel weird.
是啊，我感觉怪怪的。

1474
01:22:11.410 --> 01:22:12.650
I feel gross.
我觉得很恶心。

1475
01:22:13.350 --> 01:22:15.070
I think we should end on that.
我想我们应该就此结束了。

1476
01:22:15.270 --> 01:22:15.430
Yeah.
好的。

1477
01:22:23.370 --> 01:22:25.450
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

1478
01:22:25.450 --> 01:22:30.970
Office Ladies is a presentation of Odyssey and is produced by Jenna Fisher and Angela Kinsey.
《办公室女士》由Odyssey呈现，由珍娜·费舍尔和安吉拉·金赛制作。

1479
01:22:31.190 --> 01:22:33.590
Our executive producer is Cassie Jerkins.
我们的执行制片人是凯西·杰金斯。

1480
01:22:33.770 --> 01:22:38.330
Our audio engineer is Sam Kiefer, and our associate producer is Ainsley Bubico.
我们的音频工程师是萨姆·基弗，助理制片人是安斯利·布比科。

1481
01:22:38.850 --> 01:22:43.110
Odyssey's executive producers are Jenna Weiss-Berman and Leah Reese-Dennis.
Odyssey的执行制片人是珍娜·韦斯-伯曼和莉亚·里斯-丹尼斯。

1482
01:22:43.450 --> 01:22:46.090
Office Ladies is mixed and mastered by Chris Basil.
《办公室女士》由克里斯·巴兹尔进行混音和母带处理。

1483
01:22:46.490 --> 01:22:49.250
Our theme song is Rubber Tree by Creed Bratton.
我们的主题曲是克里德·布拉顿演唱的《橡胶树》。
